Zero point energy                ...      0.28041982 Eh     175.97 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01164804 Eh       7.31 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
